view[id=diffraction_view, loc=right, ref=pressure_view]:
bullets[id=diffraction_bullets, type=-, align=left]:
- Fresnel diffraction (Huygens Fresnel principle)
- Babinet's principle
- I(\theta) = I_0 \left[\frac{\sin(\beta)}{\beta}\right]^2
- \beta = \frac{\pi d \sin(\theta)}{\lambda}
- d = \frac{\lambda L}{x}

view[id=air_resistance_view, loc=right, ref=diffraction_view]:
bullets[id=air_resistance_bullets, type=-, align=left]:
- \frac{dv}{dt} = g - \alpha v^2 \quad \alpha = \frac{\rho C_d A}{2m}
- v(t) = \sqrt{\frac{g}{\alpha}} \tanh\left(\sqrt{g\alpha}\,t\right), \quad h(t) = h_0 + \frac{1}{\alpha}\ln\left[\cosh\left(\sqrt{g\alpha}\,t\right)\right]
- h(t) \approx h_0 + \frac{1}{2}gt^2 - \frac{\alpha g^2}{12}t^4
- \alpha = \frac{6}{g t_2^4}\left(t_2^2 - t_1^2\right) = \frac{6}{g t_2^4}\left(\Delta t\right)\left(t_1 + t_2\right)
- \rho = \frac{12 m_{\text{pp}}}{C_d A_{\text{pp}} g t_2^4}\left(t_2^2 - t_1^2\right) = \frac{12 m_{\text{pp}}}{C_d \pi r_{\text{pp}}^2 g t_2^4}\left(t_2^2 - t_1^2\right)
- r_{\text{pp}} = 20\,\text{mm}, \quad r_{\text{m}} = 7.5\,\text{mm}, \quad \text{marble drag negligible} \Rightarrow t_1 \approx t_{\text{vac}}

